{
  "id": "superdsh.office",
  "name": "SuperDsh 办公工具",
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "license": "MIT",
  "description": "可配置、可组合的办公与资料工具实现包",
  "runtime": "python",
  "entrypoint": "toolkits/office/worker.py",
  "tools": [
    {
      "id": "knowledge_search",
      "name": "查询公司资料",
      "description": "检索授权资料并返回可核对的原文证据。",
      "mode": "read",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["query"],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "query": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 2000
          }
        }
      },
      "configurationSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "maxResults": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 8,
            "title": "检索结果数量",
            "default": 8
          }
        }
      },
      "permissions": ["sessions.read"],
      "artifactTypes": [],
      "timeoutSeconds": 90
    },
    {
      "id": "spreadsheet_report",
      "name": "处理办公 Excel",
      "description": "检查资料、确认计算口径并生成可编辑 Excel。",
      "mode": "office",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["action"],
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["inspect", "plan", "execute"],
            "description": "inspect仅检查；plan准备方案并等待用户确认；execute使用相同方案执行。"
          },
          "planJson": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 200000,
            "description": "按工具guide提交JSON方案，禁止Markdown围栏。"
          },
          "inputsJson": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 20000,
            "description": "授权输入数组JSON，每项assetId/artifactId/attachmentName选一，可指定role。"
          },
          "previousArtifactId": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 200,
            "description": "修订的同会话原成果ID。"
          },
          "revisionJson": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 200000,
            "description": "带baseHash和逐项修改的结构修订JSON。"
          },
          "dataAssetId": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 200
          },
          "templateAssetId": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 200
          },
          "attachmentName": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 255
          },
          "attachmentHash": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 64
          },
          "allowValueExtraction": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "明确允许从不支持视觉对象的工作簿仅提取数据。"
          },
          "sources": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 20000
              },
              {
                "type": "array",
                "maxItems": 20,
                "items": {
                  "type": "object"
                }
              }
            ],
            "description": "inspect的数据源选择与表头映射。"
          }
        }
      },
      "configurationSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "companyName": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 120,
            "title": "公司名称"
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 160,
            "title": "默认标题"
          }
        }
      },
      "permissions": ["sessions.run", "files.write"],
      "artifactTypes": [
        "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet"
      ],
      "timeoutSeconds": 300,
      "guide": "通用 Excel 工具，先 action=inspect 检查输入，再 action=plan 提交 planJson。系统会暂停等待用户确认，确认后才保存成果。\ninputsJson 是数组，每项仅指定 assetId、artifactId 或 attachmentName（可加 attachmentHash）之一，role 为 input/template/knowledge/image。不要自动选用示例资料。无输入时可以创建空白工作表。\nplanJson: {title,filename?,sources?:[{fileIndex,sheet?,headerRow?,mapping?:{原字段:新字段}}],allowValueExtraction?:boolean,sheets:[{name,source,operations?,charts?}]}。\nsource 是 inspect 返回的 table.id 或 {columns:[字段名],rows:[[值]]}。\noperations 支持：select {columns:string[]}；rename {columns:{原名:新名}}；trim {columns:string[]}；convert {column,to:number|text|date|boolean,onInvalid:error|blank}；filter {conditions:[{column,operator:eq|ne|gt|gte|lt|lte|contains|empty|notEmpty,value?}],match:all|any}；sort {by:[{column,direction:asc|desc}]}；dedup {columns}；concat {tables:tableId[]}；join {table,leftKey,rightKey,how:left|inner,columns:{右字段:输出字段}}；group {by:string[],aggregates:[{column,as,operation:sum|average|min|max|count|countDistinct}],currencyColumn?}；pivot {rows:string[],columns:字段名,value:字段名,operation:sum|count,currencyColumn?}；formula {column,expression,numberFormat?}。每项均需 type。\nexpression 是 {literal:值}、{column:字段名}、{op:+|-|*|/|=|<>|<|<=|>|>=,left:expression,right:expression}、{fn:IF|ROUND|ABS|YEAR|MONTH|DAY|DATE|DAYS|CONCAT|TRIM|UPPER|LOWER,args:expression[]}、{aggregate:sum|average|min|max|count|countDistinct,column,where?:condition} 或 {lookup:{table,keyColumn,value:expression,returnColumn,missing?}}，禁止脚本。金额用工具计算，不手填计算结果。\ncharts:[{type:column|line|pie,title,category:字段名,values:[字段名]}]。不同币种需分组。订单编号不等于明细唯一键。没有成本不能计算利润。\n修改成果时指定 previousArtifactId，必要时通过 inputsJson 引用原 artifactId；新结果不覆盖旧文件。",
      "supportsPreparation": true,
      "readActions": ["inspect"]
    },
    {
